{"id":"3a32009d673e1bd4","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-reals-cauchy.md","title":"Real Numbers Cauchy Construction","display":"df-reals-cauchy — Real Numbers Cauchy Construction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-reals-cauchy","aliases":["58-df-reals-cauchy"],"display":"df-reals-cauchy — Real Numbers Cauchy Construction","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-cauchyseq.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-reals-cauchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-reals-cauchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reals-cauchy — Real Numbers Cauchy Construction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aacfe95320c32726\" href=\"?note=aacfe95320c32726\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-cauchyseq.md\">../batch08/58-df-cauchyseq.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"21c0965b79ed66aa\" href=\"?note=21c0965b79ed66aa\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-rational.md\">../batch13/58-df-rational.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2e668662ec71d852\" href=\"?note=2e668662ec71d852\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,C,E\\in V\">\\(R,C,E\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\)</span> 及其规范序、减法和绝对值使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"21c0965b79ed66aa\" href=\"?note=21c0965b79ed66aa\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-rational.md\">../batch13/58-df-rational.md</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q^\\omega\">\\(\\mathbb Q^\\omega\\)</span> 是有理数值函数列的集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(R,C,E)\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(R,C,E)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2e668662ec71d852\" href=\"?note=2e668662ec71d852\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CauchyReals}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{CauchyReals}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>；Cauchy 条件直接写在 Assertion 中，不依赖一个未定义的专用下标谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reals\\text{-}cauchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CauchyReals}_S(R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C,E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\nC=\\{x\\in\\mathbb Q^\\omega\\mid \\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb Q_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq m\\land N\\leq n\\to|x(m)-x(n)|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land E=\\left\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in C\\times C\\,\\middle|\\,\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb Q_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n(N\\leq n\\to |x(n)-y(n)|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(R,C,E)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reals\\text{-}cauchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CauchyReals}_S(R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C,E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\nC=\\{x\\in\\mathbb Q^\\omega\\mid \\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb Q_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq m\\land N\\leq n\\to|x(m)-x(n)|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land E=\\left\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in C\\times C\\,\\middle|\\,\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb Q_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n(N\\leq n\\to |x(n)-y(n)|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(R,C,E)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> identifies precisely those rational Cauchy sequences whose difference converges to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The quotient is formed by the registered quotient-set relation, which also verifies that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> is an equivalence relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Field operations and the order on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> are induced componentwise and must be shown independent of representatives downstream.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-cauchyseq.md","status":"resolved","id":"aacfe95320c32726","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-cauchyseq.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-rational.md","status":"resolved","id":"21c0965b79ed66aa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e668662ec71d852","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-rational.md","status":"resolved","id":"21c0965b79ed66aa","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb Q$ 及其规范序、减法和绝对值使用 [[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]；$\\mathbb Q^\\omega$ 是有理数值函数列的集合。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e668662ec71d852","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(R,C,E)$ 使用 [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,C,E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(R,C,E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CauchyReals}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reals\\text{-}cauchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CauchyReals}_S(R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C,E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&\nC=\\{x\\in\\mathbb Q^\\omega\\mid \\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb Q_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq m\\land N\\leq n\\to|x(m)-x(n)|<\\varepsilon)\\}\\\\\n&{}\\land E=\\left\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in C\\times C\\,\\middle|\\,\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb Q_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n(N\\leq n\\to |x(n)-y(n)|<\\varepsilon)\\right\\}\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(R,C,E)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":1732,"backlinks":[{"id":"1746581a68e233ce","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1049","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-reals-cauchy.md|58-df-reals-cauchy]]（batch01）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-103","loca